{%- doc -%}
  Outputs the free UK delivery threshold in pence (Theme settings > Bag > "Free delivery over (£)"),
  or 0 when free delivery doesn't apply to this visitor (not paying in pounds, or not in the UK).
  The one place the threshold is parsed: snippets/cart-drawer.liquid captures it once and passes it
  to the delivery bar, the footer rows and the add-ons. "Show free delivery bar" is checked by the
  callers that only show something when the bar is on.

  @example
  {%- capture threshold -%}{% render 'coszus-free-delivery-threshold' %}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign threshold = threshold | strip | plus: 0 -%}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign threshold = settings.coszus_free_delivery_threshold | remove: '£' | remove: ',' | strip | times: 100 | round
  unless threshold > 0 and cart.currency.iso_code == 'GBP' and localization.country.iso_code == 'GB'
    assign threshold = 0
  endunless
  echo threshold
-%}
